  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HGCgPZ8D\">如果你要投放产品目录营销（以下简称DPA）首先需要有改投放的权限，可联系对接运营同学了解，创建DPA计划组、计划、创意与其他类型的营销有着部分区别，具体如下：</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-QdIRLQL7\" id=\"h6f20189-QdIRLQL7\">项目投放接口</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-Uoj436P9\">营销目的landing_type新增DPA枚举，如果要创建DPA计划组则campaign/create接口的landing_type字段需要传DPA值。</p><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><p data-id=\"p838747a-HAy8hEaa\">针对DPA营销，其他类型的营销无需使用：</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-9clFR3Fs\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-wP3VljwL\"><col data-id=\"cf5bf93f-PklMOHfP\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.25740318906606%\"/><col data-id=\"c200789e-35bZR10g\" span=\"1\" width=\"24.715261958997722%\"/><col data-id=\"cacea180-1YA0HA8m\" span=\"1\" width=\"42.027334851936224%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-E5JeZa2d\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-C2a5pznZ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-SIDxQLk0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uAsgfugu\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-5lKbkw7i\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pZUca4A0\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-KrRvwU2m\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5dZPrVl5\">备注</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-3PF6KPg6\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-0ZmOqH7x\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DL5gYp1A\">product_platform_id</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-wIgTxqUS\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Le7PJXEu\">int</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-Cf2ZVXPm\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PWgvRzxO\">商品库id，(ID由查询可用查询可用商品库接口得到), 当营销目的landing_type=DPA时必填</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-OriX5W4F\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-hNmiXN5D\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iSPwkheA\">category_type</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-twVnFW7U\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WLu2BsEc\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-tgncwZ4C\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7XNbLfL5\">商品投放范围，NONE不限，CATEGORY按分类，PRODUCT按商品id</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-hjESbFE6\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-8dOVMOMU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZSjNy73Q\">dpa_categories</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-UfK6CNGP\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qZoEyhwF\">list&lt;int&gt;</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-jdf1DKGV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wPo3bQbl\">分类列表，投放范围为分类时必填</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-bU74lJi1\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-xtIRG40m\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sU4nFpdO\">dpa_products</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-hF3x0J0c\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ui6ktqBy\">list&lt;int&gt;</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-OgmASMdE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1lBsi9Qe\">商品列表，投放范围为商品时必填</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-8fqS7BSP\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-XhHNDIXh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HofG1cGi\">dpa_adtype</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-M5QBIkNA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UFrN2oX8\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-2ZQpWoPi\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7JmxVCyx\">dpa营销类型，落地页，应用下载二选一，DPA_LINK落地页，DPA_APP应用下载</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-uYO6YiYv\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-6acSg6ab\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XdrSw2s0\">params_type</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-8D0h7hyp\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WLTYi9CR\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-D2wAfh6j\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZsAtRXjR\">落地页链接类型，DPA商品库链接，CUSTOM自定义链接</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-VNsk2xuR\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-rRrHmS6T\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MeNyZkJS\">dpa_external_urls</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-mABjjo7T\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jx2uNnEk\">list&lt;string&gt;</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-kA5g58RF\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xnUbJxJ1\">落地页链接列表，自定义链接必填，目前只能填一个</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ctbUm5lp\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-M2ocWtw5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iwfKarNe\">dpa_external_url_field</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-gUFOL6D1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NHUck15n\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-II2DK0Cb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tZX0dAkg\">商品库链接必填，规则详见 ad维度落地页链接规则</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-b6Qi9Dma\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-DLFUHwgT\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bSvNlOSs\">dpa_open_url_type</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-q0YPbgeE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-64V8D1Qr\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-N06zimqE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rzbCUGF7\">直达链接类型，NONE无，DPA商品库链接，CUSTOM自定义链接</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-fEv8YMxS\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-3tm6qJ7h\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Wn5PmLjS\">dpa_open_urls</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-pKY3Q8Qa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7XdORCFV\">list</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-bcmCW5jq\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qk0CU4bK\">直达链接列表，自定义链接必填，目前只能填一个</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-2wxGR0Ma\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-m9ENJQFc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gfGVs4nU\">dpa_open_url_field</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-B8ViqAik\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HEO3RQML\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-2YYW5GxZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4mdnctpN\">商品库链接必填，规则详见 ad维度直达链接规则</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-IZywBpHc\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-hTBXQt86\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oMCdPTeG\">dpa_product_target</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Rqkj0hxV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yT1C8diP\">list&lt;dpaproducttarget&gt;</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-j4TpCnmP\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9yGpqaKA\">商品库定向</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-LjOe5mnp\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-QwmJy0Y0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ady9Iry2\">user_type</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-3IebvsBx\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PFI7dxo9\">list&lt;string&gt;</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-fyikDD6z\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6flocRXn\">自定义定向</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-LhlW5wVH\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-02Beh6mV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bWU2tElI\">external_url_params</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-67h6nQbV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bdPwLWC9\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-M16g2yzD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zuHkPqF8\">H5地址参数(DPA营销目的特有,在填写的参数后面添加\"=urlencode(开放平台提供的h5链接地址）\"，其中urlencode(开放平台提供的h5链接地址）替换为商品库中的h5地址encode的结果)</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-xFbUN8pQ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-1BIrEyVu\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qeSNpF1p\">open_url_params</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-6NuMsgHO\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6XRbzzsv\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-KVbJSbK1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hfY5kk8I\">直达链接参数((DPA营销目的特有,在“产品库中提取的scheme地址\"后面追加填写的参数)</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-9Q9Csy9H\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-RYqmTBQn\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wIgVqei7\">dpa_local_audience</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-Cf0WEXaG\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0gHrY7gR\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-AKMGlw6p\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-99A7euXU\">是否自定义商品定向((DPA营销目的特有,1表示自定义)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-uTvpgTV7\" id=\"h6f20189-uTvpgTV7\">DPA产品投放条件字段格式</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-ya4dh1c6\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-qqjLgX5t\"><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-7GPdeZhE\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-yARTz5kS\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-AcaPRcI8\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-WX48kDOA\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-zPtqxjVh\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-Ttj5WWP9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aEJKqb1d\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-Efqiz1ps\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BSSS4R80\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-EBPpkxIh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-IFmRmgZY\">备注</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-VI8DeJ4b\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-QLy3f1iu\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lx3tR8KF\">title</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-THtELdRT\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-G6OVPyhd\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-zsHfjHcy\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NdzJ2Xhj\">筛选条件，规则详见 **DPA计划监测直达链接规则**</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-sttP1jax\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-s0kBYkhi\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XEucYvb6\">type</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-rdpt1JnW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XBmVuIoz\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-oJsJVjV5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WJipN7s9\">条件类型</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ryj0Ur4m\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-yvF24rW1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pecFli87\">rule</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-4LkCNfE7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-K7EyoUpG\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-9EXlqvf7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bPjAPxqr\">规则针对 type为int, long, double, floatrule可选：=, !=, &gt;, &gt;=, &lt;, &lt;=针对 type为 stringrule可选：=, !=, contain（包含）, exclude（不包含）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-poRrRjGW\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-7a2OBRcj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-r7dxkt01\">value</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-gUzXXj53\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EjtVqcHI\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-uacuZErL\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TY2K735B\">值，可以输入多个，用\\n分隔</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-4kg2gDQK\" id=\"h6f20189-4kg2gDQK\">DPA人群行为字段格式</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-h7OHvpYT\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-luvuSu9F\"><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-LGZVZkmA\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-ESDVMYnw\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-IVbBygTT\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-RVLKvACd\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-H4RKku8K\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-vg8NNOrO\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZC5Zq1B2\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-w0VzBgJU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FQ1bEG84\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-tk92tLuM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-o7dCFRfh\">备注</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-qz1rniSB\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-jn2lcbxZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5vm5wgNN\">code</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-dDzqczcX\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3ypvVyNO\">int</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-aHIqSutv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RQxP7emG\">人群行为，通过人群行为接口获得</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-kAxXhJAT\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-tkt7AFM2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iGnVfszT\">days</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-h1KLb40G\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lrYJ2wW3\">int</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-8WtzF9T0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2F4987OO\">天数，可选1，7，14，28，60，90，120，180</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-9TBOuHZx\" id=\"h6f20189-9TBOuHZx\">DPA营销落地页链接规则</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-DHWri6AT\">使用商品库元信息获得，用media_type=4进行过滤<br/>使用返回中title = targetUrlMobile, brandUrlMobile, shopKeeperUrlMobile的 field_group字段即可。<br/><img alt=\"image\" data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/6e00182cab2a473e84482e95576642bf~noop.image?x-expires=1989216507&amp;x-signature=LHLOaDrKLBvZ6i5W7CEljAvZRyI%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" title=\"image\"/><br/>如此处选择使用商品库所含链接，如下：<br/><img alt=\"image\" data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/54f92b5b7a2c47078b1f0a37b361c1bc~noop.image?x-expires=1989216507&amp;x-signature=6%2Fu6ocuQOYL%2BVPaNQrzQcLi3Sqk%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" title=\"image\"/><br/>对应的参数是</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22params_type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22DPA%5C%22%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22dpa_external_url_field%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22targetUrl%5C%22%2C%20%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8field_group%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%5C%22dpa_external_urls%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5D%20%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%221zJH1%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-p9BEE8DV\" id=\"h6f20189-p9BEE8DV\">DPA计划直达链接规则</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-YEN2ghVp\">使用商品库元信息获得，用media_type=4进行过滤， 使用返回中title = targetUrlIOSApp、targetUrlAndroidApp、brandUrlIOSApp、brandUrlAndroidApp、shopKeeperUrlIOSApp、shopKeeperUrlAndroidApp的 field_group字段即可。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hGaBBZqp\"><img alt=\"image\" data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/36224d63e3e448e2b59627b506697d3d~noop.image?x-expires=1989216507&amp;x-signature=VhIbVQgtNAgVABcxOX%2FuspJLS8k%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" title=\"image\"/><br/>例如这里，可以使用传targetUrl<br/>如果是 安卓应用下载，可以使用title为targetUrlAndroidApp的field_group<br/>如果是 IOS应用下载，可以使用title为targetUrlIOSApp的field_group<br/>如果直达链接选择商品库所含链接，同落地页链接规则，使用参数如下：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22dpa_open_url_type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22DPA%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22dpa_open_url_field%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22targetUrl%5C%22%2C%20%23%20%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%8A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%5C%22dpa_open_urls%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ILeYc%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-AqZUtJ9H\" id=\"h6f20189-AqZUtJ9H\">DPA计划监测直达链接规则</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-qujFJXkM\">使用商品库元信息获得，用indexable=1进行过滤 使用 返回中 的 title和type，rule和value根据规则填写</p><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-B5yGQKtj\" id=\"h6f20189-B5yGQKtj\">营销创意投放接口</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-vvR2Qh1g\">针对DPA创意，创意创建接口和创意更新接口的创意拼装方式与普通创意将有比较大的区别，DPA创意使用的是创意模板的方式新增了创意ID，并且DPA的创意动态词包用的是新字段，具体如下：</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-YNj6o98X\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-XJpAKvZh\"><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-GjkrQBmQ\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-BqbZpKgK\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-x9EV36y3\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-MoButikL\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-O8nGozkI\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-cXY6xFgg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qfrOm44i\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-T1YFQzQB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BKPniwDy\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-EX7UvbWE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KOIBIpJY\">备注</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-LEcSwDlR\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-3ucV2Hpk\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SNZh7DKM\">dpa_dict_ids</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-ZBJUnx0Q\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5Oix8B0C\">list&lt;int&gt;</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-qe1IOh51\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-D5dkhrPE\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-HI9J3dHC\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-qbxm6QCd\">dpa词包列表，对应的标题中应该用$$将替换词包围，格式如下：\"\"。<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffa900;\">词包名$</span></span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-HAF6CWHH\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffa900;\">词包名$</span></span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-49iJ1yVv\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-LpHBrsOe\"><br/></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-VFe5A9rO\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-Q8McqU5c\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NykcNivM\">template_id</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-7fl7MaNk\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mtJEtpx5\">int</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-q0sFDaQS\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rmlBTB29\">模板id，注意点：仅大图小图组图能够使用模板，创意类型需要和模板类型相匹配，比如小图只能用小图的模板。</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-RGbQUjuR\" id=\"h6f20189-RGbQUjuR\">示例</h3><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%88%9B%E6%84%8F%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22ad_id%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%22%3A%20123%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22creatives%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22image_mode%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_LARGE%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22title%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22image_ids%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22template_id%5C%22%3A%20123%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22dpa_dict_ids%5C%22%3A%20%5B123%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22image_mode%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22title%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22image_id%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22video_id%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22inventory_type%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5C%22INVENTORY_FEED%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22ad_keywords%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5C%22xx%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22ad_category%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22creat